<h1 style="margin: 0; font-family: Fraunces, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(42px, 5.4vw, 74px); line-height: 1.04; letter-spacing: -0.015em; color: #33503F">Lorem ipsum dolor sit <em style="font-style: italic; color: #7A5C46">amet</em>, consectetur adipiscing.</h1>
