<a href="/osteopathy" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; padding: 16px 26px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1.5px solid #9DB394; color: #33503F; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px">What is osteopathy?</a>
</div>
</div>
<div style="flex: 1 1 380px; min-width: 0; position: relative; display: flex; justify-content: center">
