<span style="width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 50%; background: #F6F3EC; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none" stroke="#7A5C46" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="14" cy="6" r="2.5"></circle><path d="M14 9v8M9 12h10M14 17l-4 7M14 17l4 7"></path></svg></span>
<span style="font-family: Fraunces, Georgia, serif; font-size: 23px; font-weight: 500; color: #33503F">Lorem ipsum</span>
<span style="color: #4A463E; flex-grow: 1">Dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit sed do eiusmod tempor.</span>
<span style="font-weight: 600; color: #7A5C46">Learn more →</span>
