<span style="font-family: Fraunces, Georgia, serif; font-size: 23px; font-weight: 500; color: #33503F">Sed do eiusmod</span>
<span style="color: #4A463E; flex-grow: 1">Duis aute irure dolor in reprehenderit in voluptate velit esse cillum.</span>
