<span style="width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 50%; background: #F6F3EC; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none" stroke="#7A5C46" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 22 11 9l5 7 3-4 6 10Z"></path></svg></span>
<span style="font-family: Fraunces, Georgia, serif; font-size: 23px; font-weight: 500; color: #33503F">Tempor incidunt</span>
