<span style="font-weight: 600; color: #7A5C46">Learn more →</span>
</a>
</div>
</section>

<Wave from="#F6F3EC" to="#EFE4D6" shape="ripple" />
<section style="background: #EFE4D6; position: relative; overflow: hidden">
<svg viewBox="0 0 1440 360" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%" fill="none" stroke="#E2D2BE" stroke-width="2"><path d="M0,120 C240,70 480,170 720,120 S1200,70 1440,120"></path><path d="M0,160 C240,110 480,210 720,160 S1200,110 1440,160"></path><path d="M0,200 C240,150 480,250 720,200 S1200,150 1440,200"></path><path d="M0,240 C240,190 480,290 720,240 S1200,190 1440,240"></path></svg>
<figure style="position: relative; max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 24px 72px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 22px; text-align: center">
<svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none" stroke="#7A5C46" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 3v11M14 14c-3 2-6 3-9 3M14 14c3 2 6 3 9 3M14 14v10M14 18c-2 2-4 4-7 5M14 18c2 2 4 4 7 5"></path></svg>
<blockquote style="margin: 0; font-family: Fraunces, Georgia, serif; font-style: italic; font-weight: 300; font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 38px); line-height: 1.3; color: #4F3B2C">“Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet — like a river finding its course, consectetur adipiscing elit sed do eiusmod.”</blockquote>
<figcaption style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #7A5C46">— Lorem Ipsum, D.O.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<Wave from="#EFE4D6" to="#F6F3EC" shape="drift" />

<section style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 24px 96px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 64px">
<div style="flex: 1 1 360px; min-width: 0; display: flex; justify-content: center">
