<p style="margin: 0; color: #4A463E">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Integer posuere erat a ante venenatis dapibus posuere velit aliquet. Donec ullamcorper nulla non metus auctor fringilla.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; color: #4A463E">Cras mattis consectetur purus sit amet fermentum. Maecenas faucibus mollis interdum, vestibulum id ligula porta felis euismod semper.</p>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px">
<span style="padding: 8px 14px; border-radius: 999px; background: #E1EAD9; color: #33503F; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500">D.O. — [School]</span>
<span style="padding: 8px 14px; border-radius: 999px; background: #E1EAD9; color: #33503F; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500">[Association] member</span>
<span style="padding: 8px 14px; border-radius: 999px; background: #E1EAD9; color: #33503F; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500">Français · English</span>
</div>
<a href="/about" style="align-self: flex-start; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 12px 0; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; color: #33503F">Read her story <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#33503F" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a>
</div>
</section>

<Wave from="#F6F3EC" to="#2F4A3A" shape="rise" opacity={0.35} />
<section style="background: #2F4A3A">
